# TASK-3X4-000 pre-submit contention snapshot and trio selection record
# Experiment: 3x4-GAAS-baseline / attempt 3x4-GAAS-baseline_v1
# Captured: 2026-09-29T09:53:50+08:00 (local assembly; remote capture timestamp at end of file)

## Selection summary

- Approved queue scope: gpu_as, gpu_ded only. gpu_free and its successors
  serve a single node and are outside the approved scope; gpu_aisg is off-limits.
- Queue/Qlist state (current, supersedes the stale historical g06-g17=gpu_as map):
  gpu_ded = g01,g02,g03,g20,g21,g22; gpu_as(+gpu_ppu) = g06..g15;
  gpu_aisg = g04,g05,g16..g19,g23,g24; gpu_free = g25.
- gpu_ded eligibility: NO node has >=4 free GPUs (g01/g03/g21/g22 0 free,
  g02 2 free, g20 3 free). No gpu_ded trio is possible.
- gpu_as eligibility (need >=4 free GPUs, >=48 free CPUs, >=1000GB free mem):
  g09 (5 GPU, 64 CPU, 1tb free; 2 jobs), g10 (6 GPU, 76 CPU, 1tb; 1 job),
  g13 (4 GPU, 52 CPU, 1tb; 1 job), g14 (7 GPU, 88 CPU, 2tb; 1 job).
  g06/g07/g08/g11/g12/g15 lack >=4 free GPUs. The pristine nodes g16/g17
  (and g04/g05) are now Qlist=gpu_aisg and therefore not eligible.
- No pristine trio exists in either approved queue. Per TASK-3X4-000
  Section 1.4D the least-contended eligible trio is selected.
- Co-tenant condition (from qstat -f below):
  * g14: job 68707, 1 GPU + 12 CPUs, ~300% CPU active, ~19 GB resident,
    231h walltime - light-active.
  * g10: job 73732, 2 GPUs + 24 CPUs, ~191% CPU, ~8 GB resident - light-active.
  * g09: jobs 73863 (1 GPU + 12 CPUs, ~110%) + 73832 (2 GPUs + 24 CPUs,
    ~282%), ~14 GB resident total - two light-active tenants.
  * g13: job 73217, 4 GPUs + 48 CPUs + 1 TB allocated, ~400% CPU,
    ~275 GB RESIDENT - heavy-idle-holder profile (exp-5 risk profile:
    large resident holdings degrade host-memory phases even when idle).
- SELECTED TRIO: g14 + g10 + g09 in queue gpu_as (all three nodes carry
  only light-active co-tenants with small resident memory). Alternative
  {g14,g10,g13} was rejected because g13 carries the single heaviest
  co-tenant (4 GPU + 48 CPU + 1 TB allocation, 275 GB resident).
- Remaining contention: all three selected nodes are non-pristine with
  1-2 light-active co-tenant jobs each; a mid-run co-tenant arrival/departure
  race between snapshot and run completion is possible and is recorded as a
  known limitation.

